                            {
                                "example_id": "ae9590b7-a485-4cef-b471-a2c1466bf618",
                                "sense_id": "48ec988d-a042-3c01-9b4c-3c1e17a7c975",
                                "text": "Although politically he claims to be a Democrat, his actions are more Republican."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c698135d-dff6-4f08-a49b-df74fa3f1db0",
                                "sense_id": "48ec988d-a042-3c01-9b4c-3c1e17a7c975",
                                "text": "Nevertheless intellectually, ideologically and politically he identified with industrialists whom he, just like Smith, saw as the usherers of progress."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "44745e1e-29c7-438d-b6ec-9455bc0a21fe",
                                "sense_id": "48ec988d-a042-3c01-9b4c-3c1e17a7c975",
                                "text": "Attorney General Merrick Garland said Thursday that when it comes to politically sensitive investigations, the Justice Department does “not shy away from cases that are controversial or sensitive or political.”"
                            }
